---
/**
 * FAJNOVKA!!! wordmark. It is a working proposal of the team, not an official mark of the city.
 * The outlines come from the team's graphic pack. The pairs AJ and KA have more space than in the pack,
 * so that no two letters touch (a test counts the letters).
 * Colours: the word takes the accent colour, the exclamation marks take the text colour.
 * A parent can set --wordmark-word and --wordmark-marks to change them.
 * The mark is hidden from screen readers; the page gives the name as text next to it.
 */
